    ("F33-PAYROLL", "{\"id\":\"F33-PAYROLL\",\"number\":33,\"kind\":\"worksheet\",\"phase\":\"fieldwork\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Payroll working paper\",\"ar\":\"ورقة عمل الرواتب والأجور\"},\"purpose\":{\"en\":\"Document every substantive procedure of the payroll cycle: the work, the results, the evidence and the conclusion, against the balances the trial balance holds.\",\"ar\":\"توثيق كل إجراء أساسي في دورة الرواتب والأجور: العمل والنتائج والأدلة والاستنتاج، مقابل الأرصدة الواردة في ميزان المراجعة.\"},\"procedures\":[\"P-PAY-003\",\"P-PAY-004\",\"P-PAY-005\",\"P-PAY-006\"],\"standards\":[\"ISA-330\",\"ISA-520\",\"ISA-530\",\"ISA-540\",\"ISA-250\"],\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"engagement\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Engagement\",\"ar\":\"الارتباط\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"client\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Entity audited\",\"ar\":\"المنشأة محل المراجعة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.client\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_start\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period from\",\"ar\":\"الفترة من\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_start\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_end\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period to\",\"ar\":\"الفترة إلى\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_end\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"framework\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Financial reporting framework\",\"ar\":\"إطار التقرير المالي\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.framework\",\"readonly\":true}]},{\"id\":\"balances\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Balances, materiality and risks\",\"ar\":\"الأرصدة والأهمية النسبية والمخاطر\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"performance_materiality\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performance materiality\",\"ar\":\"مادية الأداء\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.performance\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"clearly_trivial\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Clearly trivial threshold\",\"ar\":\"حد المبالغ التافهة بشكل واضح\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.clearly_trivial\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_ebo\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Employee benefit obligations (LS-EBO)\",\"ar\":\"Employee benefit obligations (LS-EBO)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-EBO\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_ebo_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Employee benefit obligations, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Employee benefit obligations، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-EBO.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_payl\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Payroll liabilities (LS-PAYL)\",\"ar\":\"Payroll liabilities (LS-PAYL)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PAYL\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_payl_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Payroll liabilities, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Payroll liabilities، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PAYL.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_staff\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Staff costs (LS-STAFF)\",\"ar\":\"Staff costs (LS-STAFF)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-STAFF\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_staff_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Staff costs, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Staff costs، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-STAFF.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"risks\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Risks placed on this cycle by the risk register\",\"ar\":\"المخاطر الموضوعة على هذه الدورة في سجل المخاطر\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"form.F04-RISK-REGISTER.risks\",\"readonly\":true,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"level\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Level\",\"ar\":\"المستوى\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"assertions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Assertions affected\",\"ar\":\"الإقرارات المتأثرة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"inheren